### New Event
# @name newEvent
POST {{baseUrl}}/event/newevent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "eventName": "Teszt esemény 4",
    "eventStart": "10:00",
    "eventEnd": "13:00",
    "eventAddress": "6500, Baja, Bácska tér, 5",
    "eventDate": "2025-04-05",
    "userId": "",
    "catId": "1",
    "description": "nagyon jo esemény gyere el"

}

### Get all Events
# @name getAll
GET {{baseUrl}}/event/get
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get one Event by if
# @name getOneById
GET {{baseUrl}}/event/get/c7a1f171-7505-41c1-9ea2-223e94fb5b46
